# Odette, Swan Princess

> Odette is not the mid laner you draft to win lane. She is the mid laner you draft to win a single teamfight window in the center of the fight, provided your team has already built a wall of CC and peel around her. Get that condition wrong and she becomes the easiest ult interrupt in the game.

