## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Sustained DPS (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Clock of Destiny, Glowing Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Glowing Wand, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Lightning Truncheon over Glowing Wand when Use when the enemy draft has low sustain and Odette needs cleaner poke tempo before committing Swan Song.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use against burst divers who can reach Odette during the channel before Guard's shield has time to matter.; Genius Wand over Divine Glaive when Use when enemies delay high Magic Defense and repeated Swan Song ticks can stack shred for the whole magic-damage lineup.
- Total cost: 11840 gold

Default ranked mid build that turns Odette's safer mana curve into repeated poke, teamfight burn, and enough shield value to finish channels.

### Frontline HP Burn (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Clock of Destiny, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Holy Crystal over Wishing Lantern when Use when the enemy has one frontline and the carries are still the targets Odette must delete.; Ice Queen Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team needs Swan Song and passive bounces to keep melee frontliners trapped in follow-up damage.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when Odette must channel into hard engage and Purify alone cannot cover the second control layer.
- Total cost: 11090 gold

Front-to-back setup for HP-stacking tanks and sustain drafts, using repeated magic hits to trigger burn, anti-heal, and current-HP pressure.

### Anti-CC Channel (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has burst threats but not enough repeated control to justify Fortitude.; Glowing Wand over Lightning Truncheon when Use against healer supports, shield-heavy comps, or sustain fighters that can outlast one Swan Song.; Holy Crystal over Blood Wings when Use when the frontline reliably peels Odette and the last slot can stay focused on raw magic-power scaling.
- Total cost: 10960 gold

Safety build for games where Odette's damage is already useful, but the real win condition is keeping Swan Song alive through control chains.

